**Intent:** Add the `ly:cli` operator skill (D5), patterned on `plugins/ly/skills/board/SKILL.md`'s frontmatter and on the brevity of `plugins/ly/skills/distill/SKILL.md`.
Its frontmatter names the skill `cli` with a one-line description saying it loads the `lyx` command index into the session; its body has a short section on when to reach for the index and when for `lyx <command> --help`, and the line `` !`lyx help index` `` so Claude Code runs the command when the skill loads, which keeps the content current at no maintenance cost.
